            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Na mpakani mwa Yuda, toka upande wa mashariki hadi upande wa magharibi, yatakuwapo matoleo mtakayotoa, upana wake mianzi elfu ishirini na tano, na urefu wake sawasawa na moja la mafungu hayo, toka upande wa mashariki hadi upande wa magharibi; na mahali patakatifu ni katikati yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matoleo hayo, mtakayomtolea BWANA, urefu wake ni mianzi elfu ishirini na tano, na upana wake elfu kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeneo hayo matakatifu yatakuwa kwa ajili ya makuhani; upande wa kaskazini urefu wake mianzi elfu ishirini na tano, na upande wa magharibi upana wake mianzi elfu kumi, na upande wa mashariki upana wake mianzi elfu kumi, na upande wa kusini urefu wake mianzi elfu ishirini na tano; na mahali patakatifu pa BWANA patakuwa katikati yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
